## DEFINITION
GalaxyRefine is an online protein structure refinement tool that improves the quality and accuracy of predicted 3D protein models.

## PURPOSE
- Refine predicted protein structures.
- Improve structural accuracy.
- Optimize side-chain conformations.
- Enhance overall model quality.

## APPLICATIONS
- Protein structure refinement.
- Structural biology research.
- Preparation for molecular docking.
- Improving models before validation.

## FILES TO UPLOAD
- PDB (.pdb) protein structure file.

## IMPORTANT POINTS
- Accepts predicted or experimentally determined protein structures.
- Produces refined protein models with improved quality.
- Commonly used before validation tools such as ERRAT and PROCHECK.
- Freely available for academic research.
